  "description": "The Dynacraft Magna Sapphire 16-inch Girls Bike is designed to make young girls feel confident and cool while riding. The black paint finish on the frame, along with the white handlebars and fork, are the perfect base for the vibrant pink and teal details throughout the bike. The custom graphics and colorful details on the handlebar pad, top tube pad, and chain guard will catch the eyes of onlookers as she rides through the neighborhood. Shiny handlebar streamers that blow in the wind add some extra excitement to every ride. Coaster brakes make stopping easy and removable/adjustable training wheels help ensure a fun and steady ride for those just learning to ride. An adjustable seat post allows the bike to grow with her, too. The 16-inch wheels and overall design are great for children ages 4-8 years. The Magna Sapphire 16-inch Girls Bike is truly a gem of a bike for young riders ready to cruise on their own.",
